  "title": "Data monetization in banking: Driving customer centricity and business value",
  "summary": "When it comes to understanding customers, compliance data typically is the best source of information because this type of data tracks everything a customer does within a financial institution—from making a payment, to executing a trade, to applying for a loan. Payments data also is extremely valuable, even though it only tells part of the customer story.",
